Date: Fri, 6 Nov 2026 08:47:33 +0530
Subject: [PATCH] jobstate: jobs worth LargeJobRewards block rewards or more
 need k >= MinKLarge (build step 6)

A provider that also mines can re-roll its verifier committee by discarding the seed block.
sim.py part H: with a third of stake colluding and a tampering gain of 10x the job, k = 2
becomes profitable to attack from about 5 block rewards; k = 3 is not, up to 100. The node
now passes the block subsidy to ApplyBlock; a JOB_POST with fee >= 5 x the miner's share of
the subsidy needs k >= 3 (verifier pay is 1% of such fees whatever k is).

Co-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>
Claude-Session: https://claude.ai/code/session_017Li1NuWZZGrbS2dbWLqQUj
